<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;Begin at the beginning,&quot; the King said gravely, &quot;and go on </span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">\\</span></span>
